  <p><el-button v-if="!governance" :disabled="!selectable" @click="choose">选择此完整受审物资序列</el-button><el-button v-if="governance&&selected.can_review" @click="beginAction('publish')">独立审核发布序列与参数</el-button><el-button v-if="governance&&selected.can_review" @click="beginAction('reject')">审核拒绝物资序列</el-button><el-button v-if="selected.can_revoke" @click="beginAction('revoke')">按原版本撤销物资序列</el-button></p>
 </article>
 <el-dialog :model-value="creating" title="完整物资日序列与明确参数" width="min(1180px,97vw)" @update:model-value="v=>!v&&closeCreate()">
  <template v-if="creating"><p>实际SKU {{itemKind}} #{{itemId}}；医院库存范围。按所选业务时区的112至366个连续完整日捕获，截止UTC不能早于相关原件的登记或治理。</p><el-form label-position="top"><el-form-item v-for="f in periodFields" :key="f[0]" :label="f[1]"><el-input v-model="period[f[0]]" :aria-label="f[1]"/></el-form-item></el-form><el-button :disabled="!periodValid||loading" @click="capture">读取完整候选、单位与逐日分组</el-button><SupplySeriesFields v-if="preview&&form" :key="preview.expected_capture_digest" v-model="form" :preview="preview"/></template>
  <template #footer><el-button @click="closeCreate">关闭</el-button><el-button :disabled="!formValid||loading" @click="create">保存全部原件声明和参数草稿</el-button></template>
 </el-dialog>
 <el-dialog :model-value="!!action" title="独立审核完整物资序列" width="min(760px,94vw)" @update:model-value="v=>!v&&closeAction()"><p>原序列 {{selected?.series_id}}，原版本 {{selected?.revision}}。技术审核不代替药师原件签署，不产生采购或库存动作。</p><el-input v-model="basis" aria-label="本次完整物资序列治理依据" type="textarea" :rows="5"/><template #footer><el-button @click="closeAction">关闭</el-button><el-button :disabled="!actionValid||loading" @click="govern">保存本次独立治理</el-button></template></el-dialog>
</section>
</template>
<script setup>
